# the docs site: .* above hides every dot-name, and .vitepress is one
!docs/.vitepress/

# same reason: .* swallowed .github/workflows/docs.yml, so a commit -a never saw it and the
# Docs workflow simply did not exist on GitHub
!.github/

# the promo film is built from these; only the video in docs/public/video is kept
promo/frames/
promo/preview/
# the film's music (Pixabay): its licence forbids handing the track out on its own, so only the film
# carries it; promo/CREDITS.md says where to get it
promo/music/mrclaps-*.mp3
RELEASENOTE.md